sible  they made preparations willy served as  the bait for aaron  but he wasn't even the real warhammer  titan shifter he just wanted aaron to  believe  that he was meanwhile the marland  military had secretly prepared  anti-titan artillery to take aaron down  once he showed up  in his titan form and beyond that the  marland military always knew  that they have superior numbers the  paradise forces don't have enough  soldiers or enough weapons to fight the  marlin army  head on so mcgath made sure that over 30  thousand marlan troops would be  in the vicinity of liberio at the time  of the festival and so  as soon as aaron's attack began mcgath  called in  those 30 000 reinforcements and told  them to converge on liberio  in order to seal all the islanders in  and not let him escape  in the mind of the marlins yes they just  suffered some serious losses because of  aaron's attack  but at least now they've got aaron  trapped and with their superior numbers  they will be able to retake the founding  titan once and for all  and if they can make that happen then  all of the sacrifices they've just made  will have been worth it except they  didn't count on attack on titan's very  own fallout boy  armin arlert back when bertolt was using  the colossal titan power on paradise  we learned that the user of the colossal  titan shifter can control how explosive  his titan transformation will become  he can make it fairly harmless if he  wants to  but he can also create a giant explosion  when transforming an explosion that  causes  mass destruction and leaves behind a  huge mushroom cloud  similar to a nuclear explosion so when  the marland reinforcements began  converging on the port and as they  prepared to hoist their trap upon  aaron armin manages to annihilate their  entire fleet by sneaking up on them on a  small fishing boat and then  detonating his massive colossal titan  transformation  with most of their reinforcements  destroyed in an instant  the marland forces suddenly don't look  nearly as strong as they did  just moments ago and the tables quickly  turn in favor of the survey core  back in the barrio peak and porco are  using their titans to fight off the  survey corps soldiers  but using their incredible agility and  their thunderspears  sasha jean and the other survey corps  members are able to disarm and defeat  pique's cartman titan in fact it looks  as if pique is about to get killed by  jean but falco intervenes he puts  himself in between  jean and his target and he begs jon to  spare  pique's life seeing a young child in his  way  jean hesitates for just a moment but  that moment is enough to mess with  jean's aim and save peak from a fatal  injury  although not fatally injured pique is  still injured  and due to her titan's slower  regeneration this  injury takes her off the battlefield for  the foreseeable future  now we've already seen jean going out of  his way to avoid civilian casualties  during the attack on liberio and we even  saw him  arguing with flock about the need to be  more careful to avoid  harm to civilians so it makes perfect  sense that jon would hesitate at the  sight of falco who is  after all just a kid but jean's  compassion may come back to haunt him  because  pique is after all an enemy soldier  and not just any soldier but a titan  shifter  meanwhile armin's colossal titan form is  finally revealed  in all its glory and it is absolutely  epic armin's massive titan has all the  basic  features of a colossal titan but it also  has its own distinct appearance that  makes it different from bertolt's titan  the differences are most visible in the  titan's face  and man those eyes are both creepy  and awesome at the same time as armin  emerges from his titan  he says that this must have been the  same sight that bertolt saw when he  breached the walls and attacked paradise  bertolt also had a bird's-eye view of  all the death and destruction that his  attack had caused to all the  ordinary people on the ground and this  single line reminds us that  armin and the survey corps didn't start  this  war they were attacked first and they  were about to be attacked  yet again after all declaring war on  paradise was the whole point of this  year's festival  in liberio that is why the paradise  forces had to act  even though their actions were bound to  cause great suffering to the people of  liberia  armin is then picked up by an airship  which is being driven by oyan kunpong  and  hanji oyankonpon is a man whose country  was oppressed by marlei  and so he defected to paradise so that  he could fight against marley  and for the freedom of his homeland this  plan to use an airship to evacuate the  survey corps members  after the attack on the barrio was  concocted by the strategic mastermind  armin himself and this demonstrates just  how quickly the forces on parodies are  adapting to modern technology and  learning how to use it  just four years ago the islanders didn't  even know what an airship  was and now they are piloting an airship  in a major military offensive  from this point on things quickly go  from bad to worse for the marlin forces  inside liberio the one and only levi  takes down  zeke's beast titan and after realizing  that the only things that can damage  lara tiber's protective crystal are the  jaw titans jaws and claws  aaron ends up using the jaw titan as a  nutcracker to crack the crystal open  and consume lara's spinal fluid which of  course  allows aaron to take the warhammer titan  power  for himself by the way the anime  revealed that willie tiber's sister and  the holder of the warhammer titan's  first name  is lara in the manga we never actually  learned her first  name after consuming the warhammer titan  aaron is about to consume the jaw titan  as well  but luckily for porco reiner finally  manages to pull himself together and he  saves porco's life  in the nick of time but despite the  sudden reappearance of reiner's armored  titan